                        "form": "den Sonnengott"
                    },
                    {
                        "form_id": "783c1baa-035c-4992-a345-ea94a54dd021",
                        "entry_id": "de08eace-e428-3dec-9df8-8f0fa6f15b6f",
                        "tags": [
                            "accusative",
                            "plural"
                        ],
                        "form": "die Sonnengötter"
                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "a7b7bf94-7a92-383c-bdc6-100e49f3ed60",
                        "entry_id": "de08eace-e428-3dec-9df8-8f0fa6f15b6f",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Gott der Sonne"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "e1b3e3a0-f5e0-4f1c-b0a0-07e4ab021081",
                                "sense_id": "a7b7bf94-7a92-383c-bdc6-100e49f3ed60",
                                "text": "Sol ist ein römischer Sonnengott."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "198a0421-3245-401c-99ae-45e6ffc6cbe3",
                                "sense_id": "a7b7bf94-7a92-383c-bdc6-100e49f3ed60",
                                "text": "„Im Zentrum erhob sich ein mit Juwelen besetzter Prachttempel, der dem semitischen Sonnengott Elagabal gewidmet war.“"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "5fd7ad60-347d-4fa7-bfc5-114f6f4f7a2c",
                                "sense_id": "a7b7bf94-7a92-383c-bdc6-100e49f3ed60",
                                "text": "„Man stellte sich vor, daß der Sonnengott selbst den zu erhebenden Befund in die Eingeweide des Tieres geschrieben hatte.“"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "5ea14391-7f15-469f-b268-8ec4d2b63767",
                                "sense_id": "a7b7bf94-7a92-383c-bdc6-100e49f3ed60",
                                "text": "„Diese Sonne ist das schöpferische göttliche Licht und wird durch den Sonnengott Re personifiziert.“"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "eb6697ab-8a6c-461b-949b-909f8df2837b",
                                "sense_id": "a7b7bf94-7a92-383c-bdc6-100e49f3ed60",
                                "text": "„Khajuraho ist übrigens keineswegs ein Sonderfall, ähnliche Darstellungen finden sich an vielen anderen Tempeln, so etwa an dem riesigen Tempel des Sonnengottes von Konarak an der Küste Orissas, den König Narasimha I. im 13. Jahrhundert errichten ließ.“"
                            }
                        ],
                        "sense_index_json": "\"1\""
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "9dad8634-6605-4587-b30c-c899c57b325d",
                        "source_entry_id": "de08eace-e428-3dec-9df8-8f0fa6f15b6f",
                        "source_sense_id": "a7b7bf94-7a92-383c-bdc6-100e49f3ed60",
                        "source_sense_description": "Gott der Sonne",
                        "target_lang_word": "sun god",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "sun god",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "a256a9b1-b1df-3027-9f8d-322a867498e7",
                                        "entry_id": "7594616a-8e6b-3210-af79-17fe64075c89",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A personification of the sun worshipped as a god."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "d3c7d0a8-25ef-4133-963f-166978626322",
                                                "sense_id": "a256a9b1-b1df-3027-9f8d-322a867498e7",
                                                "text": "In the New Kingdom, the power of Amen was nearly absolute. Amen is paired with the sun god, Ra, and is referred to as “a fierce red-eyed lion.”"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "3c03aaaa-b603-4c16-99b9-31647b026902",
                                                "sense_id": "a256a9b1-b1df-3027-9f8d-322a867498e7",
                                                "text": "So they sacrificed to the sun god in the morning, to the earth goddess at noon, and to a mixed lot of fairies and demons in the evening."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "6eefd9a2-2418-49b0-8a67-37602ce33ca6",
                                                "sense_id": "a256a9b1-b1df-3027-9f8d-322a867498e7",
                                                "text": "He claims that the pendulums can have a hypnotic effect on the sun god and cause him to sink into a long slumber."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "76cba541-2a3c-40ef-9903-8f17516ce5b1",
                        "source_entry_id": "de08eace-e428-3dec-9df8-8f0fa6f15b6f",
                        "source_sense_id": "a7b7bf94-7a92-383c-bdc6-100e49f3ed60",
                        "source_sense_description": "Gott der Sonne",
                        "target_lang_word": "god of the sun",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": []
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "13ddb489-e7ec-4b3f-877d-8a3fa427381e",
                        "source_entry_id": "de08eace-e428-3dec-9df8-8f0fa6f15b6f",
                        "source_sense_id": "a7b7bf94-7a92-383c-bdc6-100e49f3ed60",
                        "source_sense_description": "Gott der Sonne",
                        "target_lang_word": "dieu du Soleil",
                        "target_lang_code": "fr",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": []
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "fac6c580-61da-4d40-b0b4-2f3c91c4ac1b",
                        "source_entry_id": "de08eace-e428-3dec-9df8-8f0fa6f15b6f",
                        "source_sense_id": "a7b7bf94-7a92-383c-bdc6-100e49f3ed60",
                        "source_sense_description": "Gott der Sonne",
                        "target_lang_word": "dieu-soleil",
                        "target_lang_code": "fr",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "dieu-soleil",
                                "target_lang_code": "fr",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "79c34071-d360-31b3-96dd-5facbd231947",
                                        "entry_id": "919f7c8a-5662-37ce-be2e-ee591255d305",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Dieu représentant le Soleil."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "2448a492-5880-4235-94ee-2264ac67f040",
                                                "sense_id": "79c34071-d360-31b3-96dd-5facbd231947",
                                                "text": "Cette descendance démontre sa légitimité et que le dieu-soleil Amon-Rê le soutient."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "6967068b-b48f-4654-a36c-e8405a9b2fad",
                                                "sense_id": "79c34071-d360-31b3-96dd-5facbd231947",
                                                "text": "Un dieu brillant, éclatant, qui a le soleil pour œil, ne peut être que le dieu-ciel, ou le dieu-soleil, soit un Zeus, un Varuṇa, soit un Indra, un Odin."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "3d6d7473-d9c9-4b65-9193-ae35c29fda1d",
                                                "sense_id": "79c34071-d360-31b3-96dd-5facbd231947",
                                                "text": "Ainsi Ouendé, le dieu principal des Mossi, serait bien un dieu-soleil, et les Mossi adoreraient bien, en lui, le soleil."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
